Hi all,

First, thank you all for your continued support of the Yocto Project. As yo=
u know, we release Yocto Project every 6 months. Now it's time for 1.4 rele=
ase Beta testing. Attached is the Beta users guide with testing instruction=
s. Please feel free to explore or forward it to anyone who could be interes=
ted. Some embedded Linux experience is preferred for Beta users.

And remember, we always have Yocto T-shirts for you if you send me the surv=
ey feedback!

Thanks again,
Song

